  },
  {
   "id": "q3",
   "at": 2.12,
   "text": "Pen drives."
  },
  {
   "id": "w1",
   "at": 4.25,
   "text": "What if your customers did all of it, themselves?"
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "at": 8.3,
   "text": "This is DocuFast."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "at": 10.0,
   "text": "Scan.",
   "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "at": 10.5,
   "text": "Upload.",
   "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "at": 11.0,
   "text": "Pay.",
   "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "at": 11.5,
   "text": "Print.",
   "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "at": 12.25,
   "text": "Your customer scans your QR,"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "at": 14.25,
   "text": "uploads any file,"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "at": 16.25,
   "text": "sees the exact price,"
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "at": 18.25,
   "text": "and pays by UPI."
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "at": 19.55,
   "text": "No cash. No change."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "at": 21.0,
   "text": "The moment they pay, the order lands on your live board."
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "at": 24.6,
   "text": "And your printer starts printing, all by itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "at": 27.15,
   "text": "Nothing to forward."
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "at": 28.2,
   "text": "You set your own prices."
  },
  {
   "id": "e2",
   "at": 30.9,
   "text": "See every rupee collected."
  },
  {
   "id": "e3",
   "at": 33.4,
   "text": "And customer files are deleted after printing."
  },
  {
   "id": "l1",
   "at": 36.25,
   "text": "In English, Telugu and Hindi."
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "at": 40.35,
   "text": "Make your print shop smarter."
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
